<title>HONG KONG: Johnson holds early gains after results.</title>
<headline>Johnson holds early gains after results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Johnson Electric Holdings Ltd held onto morning gains after it announced a 38.3 percent rise in interim net profit to HK$211.29 million on Monday afternoon, brokers said.</p>
<p>The share was at HK$19.80, up HK$0.10, in late afternoon trade on turnover 31,000 shares worth HK$619,800.</p>
<p>&quot;Trading in the shares is relatively quiet and seems uninspired by the results announcement,&quot; a broker said.</p>
<p>Johnson Electric designs and manufactures micro-motors.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
